     <p class="paraCommon paraHeader" >
        <b>Where do you find real green job openings</b>
        <span style="font-size:18px;"><b>From Understanding the Green Economy → To Finding Your Place in It.”</b></span>
    </p>
        <p class="paraCommon"><span style="font-size:22px;display:block;margin-top:10px;">Up till now, you’ve explored the WHY and the WHAT of the green economy.</span></p>
        <p class="paraCommon">Now let’s look at the WHERE. </p>
        <p class="paraCommon"><b>Where do real opportunities hide? How do you discover them?</b></p>
        <p class="paraCommon">This is the compass. </p>
        <p class="paraCommon">It prepares, guides, decode the green economy and connects you to the right terrain.  </p>
        <p class="paraCommon">Internships, fellowships, campus gigs, full-time roles; we scout the entire green universe like hawk-eyed detectives so you don’t have to doom -scroll at midnight and open 50 tabs and cry.</p>

        <p class="paraCommon"><b>1. We don’t just guarantee placements - we also guarantee clarity;</b> Our job isn’t to push you into any vacancy. It is to help you see the landscape clearly so <i>you make better choices.</i> </p>
        <p class="paraCommon"><b>2. We curate and decode opportunities, not act just as recruiters;</b> We don’t just shortlist CVs, schedule interviews, or chase candidates. We scan the green economy, filter the noise, and show what actually matters.</p>
        <p class="paraCommon"><b>3. We help both sides understand each other better;</b> Students, Gen Z, mid-career professionals, silver talent, startups, employers, everyone is confused. We simply make the conversation easier, smarter, and more grounded.</p>
        <p class="paraCommon">"We’re not like any another recruitment cum placement agency. What you get here is something more fundamental: you get the map of the green economy, decode the skills, curate real opportunities, and understand where you actually fit. </p>
        <p class="paraCommon"><b>Think of www.greenjobs.digital as your green career GPS - you drive the car, we show the roads."</b></p>
        <p class="paraCommon"></p>
    </div>



     <div class="bgJbSearch2UperText hometext">
        <p class="paraCommon" style="font-size:24px;">
            <b>**Why us ?</b>
    </p>
    </div>
    
     <div class="bgJbSearch2LowerText hometext">
          <div style="text-align:center;padding-top:10px " >
            <img src="~/images/job-search3.jpg" width="50%" />
    </div>
        <p class="paraCommon">Short answer: Because we’ve been doing this before it was cool. ** Five years ago, when everyone else was obsessed with coding boot-camps, we were quietly building <b><a href="www.hellokisan.org" target="_blank">www.hellokisan.org</a> </b> a knowledge platform that decoded the <i>OG green economy:</i> farming, food systems, forests, waste, recycling, circular economy.</p>
        <p class="paraCommon">While others were busy writing “Green Jobs are the future” LinkedIn posts, we were actually helping people build those futures. </p>
        <p class="paraCommon">
            <b>300+ startups supported.</b><br />
            <b>10,000+ green jobs created.</b><br />
            <b>Zero bragging… okay maybe small bragging.</b> 

        </p>
        <p class="paraCommon">We didn’t learn the green economy from PowerPoint.</p>
        <p class="paraCommon">We learnt it from field mud, factory floors, FPO meetings, solar rooftops, cold chains, recycling yards, and those heroic entrepreneurs who stubbornly refuse to give up.</p>
      
    </div>



     <div class="bgJbSearch3UperText hometext">
        <p class="paraCommon" style="font-size:24px; ">
            <b>**And now?</b>
    </p>
    </div>
    
     <div class="bgJbSearch3LowerText hometext">
          <div style="text-align:center; padding-top:10px" >
            <img src="~/images/job-search4.jpg" width="50%" />
    </div>
        <p class="paraCommon">The green world has exploded. **</p>
        <p class="paraCommon">Solar, wind, biomass, EVs, climate-tech, carbon removal, sustainable materials, recycling 2.0, everyone is hiring and nobody has enough trained people.</p>
        <p class="paraCommon">So we said: <b>Let’s build something crazy useful.</b></p>
        <p class="paraCommon">A single place where interns, students, freshers, career-switchers, and silver talent can all discover real green opportunities.</p>
        <p class="paraCommon">Welcome to <a href="https://greenjobs.digital" target="_blank">www.greenjobs.digital</a></p>
        <p class="paraCommon">It’s not a job board. It’s a <i>talent spaceship</i> for the green economy.</p>
    </div>
 
